{
 "about": "Illustration from paths: a route drawn on as a single ink line over faint contour lines, its two ends marked and named, then a close crop on the destination. Taste decision it demonstrates: a 2D medium that comes from the subject (a journey is a line), negative space given texture instead of a gradient, two colours (navy ink on cream, the second ink only on the dots), motion with weight (draw-on on inOutQuart, dots that settle with a 3% overshoot) and an acoustic score (TASTE.md §2, §3, §5, §8). Replace the path with the brief's own shape: a route, a signal, a growth curve, an outline of its object. Don't use it for abstract claims with no shape of their own.",
